<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Hibru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hibru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hibru</para>
  <para style="mt">Hibru</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">God ye Wam mina kamo i nogugl ede norukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Ana okna ibo God ye ege mere nono kowano awano ka di togwa igne, ye kamo kep yoba meglkwa i, nomane togo, ye kamo i pi kowano awanoma di teigwa. Te, God ye ka kep yoba nomane togwa i, konbauna kane kane mina nomane togwa. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />God okna yegl erukwa ba erme taragl mudu dudunabuka magigl erukwa igne, ye Wam mina ka di norukwa. God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i, ye Wam mina ere yedre, te ye Wam i, taragl mudu kaima idre, bitno morabedi kere i pere ede kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Ana God Wam moglkwa i, God abuglagemo podo sumere yegl ye abuglagemo podo sugwa te, God siragl mere moglkwa i, ye kuno ere i nogugl ede norukwa. Te, God Wam kamo yobuglomo podo paugwa pre ye ka dumara i mina taragl pra pra suglno moglkwa. Ama nono deno muduno tadaglme paikran, pe sinabedi konbauna yauro noro, okuo ye ede heven ibo pidre, God mogl mitna kaima edugwa i, ogo wo kra ame di moglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Wam mogl mitna ede angelo togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Ana God ye Wam kagie podo kide togwa pre ye kagie pai mitna edugo, angelo mudu kagno pai atne edugo, erukwa. Yegl pre God Wam swara i, mogl mitna kaima edidre, angelo mudu egre togwa. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />God okna ye Wam di tedre, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Ene na Wana motngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Na erme ene Nen moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">dugwa. Te, God ka ta ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Na ye Nem moglbo, ye na Wana morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samuel 7.14</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">dugwa. Ye Wam pre ka yegl dugwa ba ye ege swara ta angelo pre ka ta yegl di tekrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Te, God ye Wam komono auro yu makandigle edenabuka ege i pre ka yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">God angeloma mudu ye kagie kade tenaiglkwa pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.43</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:6">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ana angelo pre God kamo bage ta yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">Ye angeloma ede u ir mere yegl enaiglmedi eruko, ye ede u ir mere yegl eigwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">Te, angelo ye niglmo kogonmo ere teigwa i, ede u doga bauglo mere yegl enaiglmedi eruko, ede u doga bauglo mere yegl eimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 104.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:7">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />God ye angeloma pre ka yegl di togwa ba ye Wam pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Ene God motnga i, ene sia king mina aimadi kamin moratnga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ene mabuno du keme ersre, yobanen suglno motnga.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ene mabuno du, wakai kandre, mabuno kide yogwa i, kide kanga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Yegl pre God, ene Godnen moglkwa i, kugo nuglo toide bitn mina edidre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Ene gun podo yenatnedi erukwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Ene kunanma i, ama gun yeigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Ba ene swara gun podo kaima yeniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gigagle 45.6-7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:9">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Ana God ye Wam pre ka ta ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Yagl Kade yo, ene okna ibo dumo makan beke yenga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">Te, kamun mitna ibo paugwa i, ene ere yenga yagle motnga.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Kugugl gagl ta bugl kide erumere mere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Kamun mitna ya dumo makan mudu u kide pidre, dudinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Ba ene mogl pai moratnga.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Yoba kugugl ake perimere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Ene kamun mitna ya dumo makan ake pere si dudinatnga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Te, yoba kugugl gagl goglo yogwa i gugl edidre, kor edimere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Ene kamun mitna ya dumo makan kor ere yenatnga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ba ene motnere yegl mogl pai moglsre, aimadi kamin moratniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 102.25-27</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:12">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />God ye Wam pre ka tau yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">Ene na ogona wo kra ame di moglo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Na ene kudanen ikne yobuglo ere tedre, kagln mina atne edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:13">dugwa. God ye Wam pre yegl dugwa ba angelo meglkwa i, ege swara ka yegl ta di tekrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Angelo mudu meglkwa i, ye murubuglo mogl, God kogonmo ersre, ye yobama ake ple di te meglkwa. God yoba ta okuo taragl wakai inaiglmedi ere yugwa yobamo i, angelo ake ple di teigwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Krais kamo kodumun, ibun inamga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ana God Wam ye mogl mitna ede, angelo mudu togwa pre nono ye kamo prumga i, ake gi di moramga. Ake gi di moglsre, ye kamo i ta kide kodo, ede eglke pi dinamnedi eramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />God okna ye lomo i, angeloma di togo, angelo i pi Moses di teigwa. God lomo i, gigledi paugo, yoba God lomo swara swarade si biglke dimere topo kide kuno ere te ikne edugwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Prio. Okna yegl erukwa ba erme God nono ere yugwa ka taragl mudu egre atne edugwa pre mokono tomin, ibun ikramnedi prikramga. Yubun podo kaima inamga. God nono ere yugwa ka i, Yaglno Kade yene dra mina komono kana dugwa. Dugo, yoba tau prisre, ka kaima yegl yegl dumiwedi nono di noriko, prumga. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Te, God yene wakai prumere ama kamo wakai yogwa i pre medraiglmedi kimagl ya diu kane kane ersre te, i ama gigledi panabedi Mudu Murubuglo mina ye yobama yobuglo ya nomane kane kane togwa. Yegl paugwa pre ye nono ere yugwa ka i, mokono tomun, ibun inamga.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas swara nono ere yugwa yagle moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Ana Krais okuo dumo makan kor ere yenabuka pre dumga i, God angelo tebo, sugl moraiglme ta dikrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Prio. Yoba ta mem i pre bage swara ta yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">God yo, no yoba munga i, ene siragl pre no pre i mitna ede motne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">No yoba yoko munga ba ene no suglno wakai motniwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />No ege sugunagle angelo meglmara mogl atne edinaiglmedi edinga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">Ba no ama ake mitna edidre, kagno kade notniwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Ene taragl kane kane ere yenga i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">No yoba mogl mitna edidre, bitno molo di notniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 8.4-6</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">di, yegl dugwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ana God ye yoba taragl kane kane bitno moraiglmedi edugwa i, ye taragl swara ta kina yeikrukwa ba yoba taragl mudu kaima bitno moraiglmedi edugwa. Ye yegl mere edugwa ba nono erme kamga i, nono yoba taragl tau sugl munga ba taragl tau sugl moglkrumga.<verse eid="HEB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Erme nono yoba taragl mudu sugl moglkrumnedi kamga ba yoba swara ta ede okna pidre, kagie podo kide yumedi kamga i, Jisas swara yugo, kamga. Jisas u yoba pidre, ege sugunagle angelo meglmara mogl atne ede moglkwa. I siragl pre Jisas yoba mudu againo idre, goran, God yoba mudu ere wakai ere tenagledi prukwa. Ana Jisas giugl podo kaima prisre, goglkwa pre ye kagie podo kide togo, erme Jisas kagie kade i kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Ana God moglkwa i, ye taragl mudu ere yedre, ama mudu bitno moglkwa. Ye yegl mere moglsre, prukwa i, yoba mere kaima na gagrama meglbi, na ye auro i ede heven ibo ebo, wakai kaima moraiglmedi prukwa. Yegl pre ye Jisas giugl prisre, yoba ere inabedi dedugwa i, kuno erukwa. Jisas giugl prumara i mina ye yene u wakai kaima pidre, nono ere yugwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ana Jisas, nono ere i God yobama edugwa yagle yogo, nono God yobama erme munga yomgo, Neno swara keme moglkwa. Swara moglkwa pre Jisas ere mogl, Ene na agrama abarama meglme dinabuka i, ye agai ta goglkrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Agai goglkrisre, ka yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">God yo, ene kagn siragl mere paugwa i, na agrama abarama di tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">na giglage mina ye makai sinaiglmara i, ene kagn kade tenaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 22.22</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:12">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Te, ye ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">Na God kaima dumedi pre medigl moraluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 8.17</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">dugwa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Te, ye ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">God ye gagiglma yu na ogona mina edugo, na ye bogl akie muniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 8.18</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14-15" />Ana Jisas ye God gagiglma pre dugwa i, nono yoba ogono nagino padre, bormaino moglkwa yoba i pre dugwa. Nono yoba yegl mere munga pre Jisas ama u yoba ogwa i, yoba ogo nagie yugwa. Jisas u yoba ogwa i, Satan yobuglomo si dudu kodo, yoba Satan moglmara atne kane pai meglkwa i, i meda edenagledi pre u yoba ogwa. Yoba makandigle wan meglkwa igne i ye gogl dinamnedi kudugl podo geglkwa pre Satan moglmara atne kane pai meglkwa. Satan moglkwa i, ye geglkwa mabuno ake moglkwa ba Jisas ye i meda edenagledi goglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="High priest" file="hk00267b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="2.16" />Ana nono kwande pre kodumga i, Jisas u ye angelo ake ple di tenagledi ukrukwa ba nono Abraham gawama munga i, ake ple di noragledi ugwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Yegl pre ye u yoba pidre, agiglema munere kuno yegl morabuka paugwa. Ye u yoba ogwa i, nono mitno goglsre, tawa teigwa yoba bitno mere yegl mogl, God kogonmo kuno kaima eragledi pre u yoba ogwa. Ye u yoba omara i, yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede, topono tenagledi u yoba ogwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Ana Jisas makandigle wan moglkwa igne, ye yubun mere yugo, Satan ama ye kina sinagledi erukwa. Yegl pre nono yoba yubun imga igne mo Satan nono kinano sugwa igne, Jisas nono ake ple di norabuka i, kuno erumedi pramga.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisas kagie kade idre, Moses egre atne edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Agrama abarama wagle, ene God yobama meglkwa i, God heven ibo moglsre, taragl tau akie inaiglmedi ene agle dugwa pre Jisas siragl mere moglkwa i, pre gi di molo. Jisas ugwa i, God Dedugwa yoba ta moglsre, ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno mere yegl ta moglkwa. Te, nono akie Jisas pre meduniwe dumga. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Ana God ye Jisas kogon yegl erabedi dedugo, dedumere ere kodugwa. Jisas yegl erukwa i, ye Moses okna ibo erumere kuno erukwa. Moses Israel yoba meglmara suna kogon erukwa i, Israel yoba God yugumo mere yegl meglko, Moses ye meglmara suna kogon tomere ere kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Ana Moses ye God kogonmo wakai erukwa ba God ye Jisas kagie kade togwa i, podo pai, Moses kagie egre i atne edugwa. Kuno yegl mere yoba ta yugu wakai kenan, yoba yugu i kandre, yugu kagie kade ta tekraiglkwa ba yugu keigwa yobamo i, kagie kade tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Te, yugu ta yene plau dikrabuka ba yoba ta yugu kenan, yenabuka. Kuno yegl mere taragl kane kane paigwa i, God ere yogwa keme paigwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Ana God yugumo suna, Moses ye God niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, ye kogonmo wakai erukwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel Kerikwa 12.7</char></note> Moses God yugumo suna nigl kogonmo erukwa i, siragl okuo ka kaima di pogl norabere mere ere wakai ere, i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ana Moses yegl erukwa ba Krais yugugl i nigl kogon yoba mere moglkrukwa. Ye God Wam moglsre, ye swara mogl mitna ede, yugu i sugl moglkwa. Te, nono God ye dumere kaima ere norabedi pre moglsre, okuo gun yenamga i pre kaima panabedi prumun, nono ama God yugumo mere yegl moramga.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel yoba God kamo sedigwa i, dumo Kenan suna pikrikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ana nono ama God yugumo mere yegl munga pre Mudu Murubuglo ka yegl di norukwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">Erme, ene na ka diga i ta pribi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />Ene nomano gigle dinabedi erekrio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">Ene kowano awano dumo wau yomara meglkwa igne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">Ye na kana sedidre, God no ere sinabo mo di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">Ye eran, kanamnedi erimere yegl, ene yegl ta erekrio.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Te, ene kowano awano i, ye bugla yugu 40-pela na yobuglna kan meglkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">Ba ye nomano gigle dugo, ye na sinaglka mere erikwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Yegl pre na yugobuno i, dena kubro tedre, yegl diga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">Yoba i, ye na konbaunana kan pogl sikre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">Deno muduno mina ege ege ede eglke eimiwe diga.<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Yegl pre na dena kubrimara i, ka gigledi yegl di padiglka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">Na yoba i auro i ede suna ebo, ye wakan moraiglme diga ikra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">Ka kaima ta plau dikrabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 95.7-11</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:11">di, God ye kamo mina yegl dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, ene kan kun erio. Ene meglmara suna i, yoba swara ta nomane kide idre, God kor meglkwa mabuno moglkwa i pre medigl moglkre, moko tenan, i kide panabuka. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ene kan kun ersre, ege ege deno muduno ikne ikne si gigle di tenaiglkwa paugwa. Ene yegl ta erekribi, tadaglme mabuno ene bakagl tedre, ene nomano si gigle di te dinabuka pre diga.<verse eid="HEB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Na diga i, nono God kamo mabuno bogl pre medunga igne, ka i ka kaima pamedi prumga. Okna ka i kaima pamedi prumnere mere yegl pre gi di mogl pi goramga paugwa. Pre gi di mogl gun, Krais taragl wakai wakai inabuka i, nono ama inamga. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ka mem yegl paugwa pre God kamo okna ibo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">Erme, ene na ka diga i ta pribi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">Ene nomano gigle dinabedi erekrio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">Ene kowano awano na kana sedemere yegl, sedekrio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 95.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:15">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ana, aglode yoba okna ibo God kamo prisre, sedime? Moses ye yoba dumo Isip kane pai dinaiglmedi agre i ede meda ugwa yobamo i, mudu God kamo prisre, sedigwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Te, God yoba tau bugla yugu 40-pela mere dem kubro togwa i, aglode yoba tome? Tadaglme erikwa yobamo i, mudu dem kubro togwa. Yoba i, dumo wau yomara wan mogl, geglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Te, God ka gigledi di te padigl, yoba tau ede dumo Kenan suna pikre, wakan moglkraiglme dugwa i, ama aglode yoba pre dume? Ye kamo sedigwa yoba i pre dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Yegl pre nono kowano awano ikra, ye God kamo pre mediglkrikwa pre ye ede dumo Kenan suna enaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekruko, prumga.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">God yobama wakan moglsre, wakai moraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Ana God okna promis ta dugwa i, Na yobanama i, wakan moraiglmiwe dugwa ikra pai moglkwa. Pai moglkwa pre ene meglmara suna i, yoba swara ta yage sidre, wakan ta moglkrabuka i, kide panabuka. Yegl pre taragl yegl mere plau di dinabedi nono kudugl goramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ana ene prio. Israel yoba okna meglkwa i, nono God kamo wakai yogwa i prumnere mere ye ama ka wakai prikwa. Ye ka wakai prikwa ba ye pre mediglkrikwa pre ka i ye ta ake ple di tekrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ba nono erme God kamo pre medunga munga i wakan moramnara ede suna enamga kuno erukwa. Ana yoba wakan moraiglmara ede suna enaiglmo mo pikraiglkwa i pre God okna yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">Na dena kubrisre, ka gigledi yegl di padiliwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">Yoba i, ye wakan moraiglmedi na ere wakai ere yei temara i, kaima ta ede suna pikraiglme die<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 95.11</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">dugwa. Moses egemo ikra mina God ka yegl dugwa ba okna ibo God dumo makan ere yei kodugwa igne, ye kogonmo dudugo, wakan mogl kodugo, prumga. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />God kamo suna i, bage swara ta de namba 7 pre yegl dugwa, Ege namba 7 we, God kogon ere kodugwa pre wakan moglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 2.2</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ba ka bage ta nono erme prumga i yegl dugwa, Yoba i, ye wakan moraiglkwa pre na ere wakai ere yei temara i, kaima ta ede suna pikraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 95.1</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ana yoba tau wakan moraiglkwa kuno erukwa ba Israel yoba okna meglkwa i, ye God kamo wakai yogwa i digo, pre mediglkrikwa pre ede suna pikrikwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Ana bugla yugu mere kide ede ogo, God ere mogl, aglke kor dagl yoba wakan moraiglmedi ege ta paduglkwa. Ye Devit dra idre, kamo mina yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:7">Erme, na ka diga i ta pribi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:7">Ene nomano gigle dinabedi erekrio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 95.7-8</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">dugwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:7">God Devit dra idre, wakan moramga pre ege ta paduglkwa i, ege erme yomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Te, Josua ye Israel yoba auro i pi dumo Kenan suna edugwa igne, ye wakan moraiglmedi tekrukwa. Ye kaima wakan moraiglmedi toma, God aglke kor ege ta yoba wakan moraiglmiwe dugwa i, ta dikruko. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga, God yobama wakan kade moramga i, yoko pai moglmedi pramga.<verse eid="HEB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Ana God yoba ta wakan moraiglmedi togwa i, ye kogono ere kodidre, wakan meglkwa. God yene okna ibo kogon ere kodidre, wakan moglmere yegl, wakan meglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Yegl pre nono wakan moramnara ede suna enamnedi kogon podo eramga paugwa. Israel yoba ye God kamo pre mediglkrikwa pre wakan moraiglmara ede suna pikrimere mere yegl, nono ama yegl yage si dinamnedi eramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Ana God kamo yogwa i, kor moglsre, kogon yobuglo ere moglkwa. Te, bainet ta dra aket aket nogwa i, podo nogwa ba God kamo bainet i egre tedre, nogwa. Ana yoba bugla togidre, dem muduo i nogugl edimere mere yegl, God kamo i, nono nomano, kwiano ya, deno muduno siragl mere paugwa i, togo i nogugl edugwa. Nono nomano mina siragl mere prumga ya kide wakai deno muduno mina prumga i, ere i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Te, God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i, mudu ye gumuglo mina nogugl paigo, kanugwa. Taragl swara ta God gumuglo mina teke paikrukwa. Te, God i gumuglo mina, nono adigl mogl, siragl mere mogl pai erumga i, di poramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yoba mogl wimara i, Jisas ede okna pi, bitno moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ana ene prio! Tawa teigwa yoba bitno ta moglmere yegl, nono tawano togwa yoba ta ama nono bitno moglkwa. Tawano togwa yoba ta nono bitno moglkwa i, Jisas, ye God Wam moglkwa i pre diga. Jisas ye ede kamun mitna pidre, ede heven ibo ogwa pre ye pre medunga i, ake gi di moramga paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />I siragl pre nono tawano togwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, nono konbo kane kane mina yage sumnara i, ye pre kan ersre, nono mitno podo kaima goglkwa. Satan konbo kane kane mina nono kinano sumere mere yegl, ye okna kuno yegl mere Jisas kina sugwa ba Jisas tadaglme ta erekrukwa. Yegl pre Jisas nono siragl mere nomane sumga i, pre kan ere kodidre, nono mitno podo goglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Yegl pre nono kudugl goglkre, God ye sia kingmo mina moglmara ede magigl enamga paugwa. God ye sia kingmo mina moglsre, yoko kaima ere wakai ere noragledi prukwa. Yegl pre nono yubuno ta panabuka igne i, God nono mitno goglsre, ake ple di norabedi ye moglmara magigl enamga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s">Jisas nono tawano togwa yagl wakai kaima ta moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, nono kamga. Tawa teigwa yoba tau mere meglmara suna i, God yagl swara ta kogon erabedi dedugwa i, ye yoba pere againo idre, God gumuglo mina ofa tedre, yoba tadaglme erimara tawa tedre, erabedi kogon togwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno ta moglkwa i, ye yoba yoko meglmere kuno yegl moglko, yobuglomo ama paikrukwa pre yoba tau nomano wakai paikrukwa mo konbauna kide kodo, ede eglke eigwa i, ye mogl atne edidre, ka kiede di tenabuka i, kuno erukwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Te, ye ama tadaglme yoba moglkwa pre ye yene tadaglmemo pre tawa tedre, yoba pere tadaglmeno pre ama tedre, erabuka paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Yoba kor ta tawa teigwa yoba bitno morabuka i, ye yene kagie kade inagledi yobaglku kogon i ta erekrabuka. Ba God ye okna Aron agle dumere yegl, ye agle dinan keme ye kogon i erabuka.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ana kuno yegl mere, Krais yene kagie kade inagledi tawano togwa yoba moglsre, bitno moragledi erekrukwa ba God ye kogon i erabedi dedugwa. God ye Krais pre dugwa i, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Ene na Wana motngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Na erme ene Nen moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:5">dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Te, ye bage ta ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">Yagl Melkisedek ye okna tawa narukwa yoba moglmere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">Ene tawa naratnga yoba aimadi moratniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:6">di, Krais pre yegl dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Ana Jisas makandigle wan moglkwa igne, ye God swara na ere inan, na goglkre, kor moraglka pamedi prisre, God kamage ere togwa. Jisas ka podo didre, kai ere, God agle di pruko, Jisas mogl atne edidre, kana duglo boglmedi kan, God ye ake ple di togwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Jisas ye God Wam moglkwa ba ye giugl yubun yumara i, yoba giugl prisre, God kamo duglo beglmere ye ama beke i kodugwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9-10" />Ye kuno ere beke yugwa pre God ye nono tawa teigwa bitno yagle morabedi padiglsre, Ene Melkisedek okna tawa togwa moglmere mere moratne dugwa. Yegl pre yoba ta Jisas duglo beglkwa i, ye tawa teigwa bitno yoba moglsre, aimadi kamin wakai kaima moraiglmedi ake ple di norukwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gak kebra mere yegl mogl, am ne moglkramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ana, no ka tau mere mem i pre ene di tenamnedi prumga ba ene kinano gi dugwa mere yegl paugwa pre no ene beke tomun, ene pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, waragne panabuka. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />I siragl pre ene okna kana pre medigl, ede suna wigwa pre ene mudu God kamo tisa moraiglkwa kuno erukwa. Ba ene tisa moglkre, gak kuglabu kaya mokna nekre, am keme neigwa i, meglmere yegl meglkwa. Yegl moglsre, God kamo bage tau nogugl kaima paugwa i, yoba ta kor dagl beke tebi, ene praiglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ana yoba ta gak kuglabu mere yegl moglsre, am ne meglkwa i, ye mabuno du siragl mere paugwa i kan yubu sidre, eraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ba yoba ta gak kebra mere moglkre, yoba kade mere yegl meglkwa i, mie gigle dugwa nenaiglkwa kuno erukwa. Ye ege mere mabuno wakai ya mabuno kide kan yubu sigwa pre ye nomano mina pre pogl sigwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="s">Yage si dinamnedi eramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1-2" />Ana Krais kamo nogugl kaima paugwa i, nono beke kodumga pre gak kebra mere yegl moglsre, kor bekenamnedi erekre, nono yoba mere yegl moglsre, ka kor kor bekenamga paugwa. Ana ka okna beke kodumga i yegl mere paugwa. God swara pre medramga paugo, mabuno tau duglo bun, kiano ake ple dinabedi prikwa i, kide kodinamga paugo, nigl bugl tenaiglmere paugo, te yoba God kogonmo eraiglmedi ogono yenamga paugo, te yoba geglkwa siragl mere adiglsre, kot kade idre, aimadi kamin doga denaiglkwa pre paugo, erukwa i, beke kodumga pre <verse eid="HEB 6:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />God ake ple di noran, ka kor kor beke pai moramga.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Yoba tau yage sigwa meglkwa i, nomane yake tenaiglmedi eramga ba kuno ta erekrabuka. I siragl pre yoba i, God nomano mina abuglage si te kodugo, Mudu Murubuglo bogl u swara eigo, God heven ibo mogl, yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa i, ye ama pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Te, yoba i, God kamo, wakai yogwa i dogon erumedi pre kodigwa. Te, God yobuglomo okuo ede nogugl unabere mere ye ama pre kan kodigwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Ana yoba yegl ta moglsre, yage si, ede meda ebi, nono ye aglke kor nomano yake tenaiglmedi erumun, kuno ta erekrabuka. I siragl pre ye mabuno erimara i, God Wam aglke kor ede prak mina sidre, ye agai gorabedi erikwa pre nono ye nomano yake tenaiglmedi erumun, kuno ta erekrabuka.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ana yoba makan mina kaya mokna ere yaiglko, kamun si, makan kugl tedre, kaya mokna wakai boglkwa igne, kaya mokna yaiglkwa yobamo i kaya mokna si i pi neigo, God dumo makan i ama ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" /><figure style="fig" alt="Briars" file="hk00122b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="6.8" />Ba ta manan, makan swara i mina kugl kide ya kan kagigle yaglkwa i keme panan, makan i, kogonmo wakai ta paikrabuka. God kuri ta mogl, makan i di kide yei tenabuka paugwa. Te, dumo makan yegl ta yenabuka i, yoba kono ken sibi, denabuka.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Agrama abarama na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, no ka gigledi ene di tomga i, aglau yegl ene meglmara plau dikrabedi prumga. God ene ere yugwa pre ene mabuno du kane kane ersre, ame wakai dinaiglmedi prumga. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ene God we di prisre, ye kogonmo ere, ye wakai kaima kanigwa i, God pre morabuka pre dumga. Ene ye wakai kanigwa pre ye yobama okna ya erme ake ple di teigwa. Ene ake ple di teimara i mina God mabuno du ersre, ye pre morabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ana no ene mudu taragl swara ta ka kaima eraiglmedi prumga i, ene God kogonmo erimere yegl, ene gigledi ere moraiglmedi prumga. God ene taragl wakai wakai tenagle dugwa i, ene kaima inamgra we di prisre, ye kogonmo ere mogl pi geglbi, i wakai panabuka. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ene oglka ere dinaiglmedi prumga. Yoba okna God pre medigl moglsre, oglka erekre, adigl gigledi mogl eimere yegl ene ama yegl eraiglmedi prumga. Ye adigl gigledi mogl eigwa i pre God ye taragl wakai wakai tenagledi ka promis dugwa i, ye kaima igwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">God ere wakai ere norabedi pre gi dinamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13-14" />Ana Abraham okna ibo moglkwa i, ene prio. God ye promis di te padiglsre, yegl dugwa, Na ka kaima ene ere wakai ere tedre, ene gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenagle dugwa. God okna yegl dugwa i, yoba ta ye moglmara mogl mitna edenan, Na yoba i kagie mina promis diwe dinabuka i, ta moglkrukwa pre God dugwa i, Nana kagna mina ka gigledi ene di te padiluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13-14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 22.16-17</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ana God ka promis dugwa i, Abraham oglka erekre, sugl mogl ogo, ogo, okuo kaima God dumere plau dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Ana yoba ka gigledi ta di te padiglkwa igne, ye yoba ta mogl mitna edigwa i kagno mina digwa. Ka gigledi yegl digo, yoba okuo ka i pre nonga dikrikwa. I siragl pre ye ka gigledi di padigl kodigwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Ana God ye Abraham ka kaima ta di tedre, yoba okuo ere wakai ere tenaluwe dugwa i, nono erme munga i, ka i kaima plau dinabedi praiglmedi pre ye ka gigledi di te paduglkwa. Nono yoba ta taragl wakai wakai ye ka gigledi di te paduglmara i ta inamga munga i, yegl pramga, God ka dugwa i, u ta pikrabuka pamedi pramga. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Ana God Abraham ka di togwa igne, ye ka suo mere dugwa. Ye ka kaima ta didre, ka gigledi ama di te paduglkwa. Ye ka suo dumara i, ka kibi ta dinan, kuno erekrabuka. Kuno erekrabuka pre nono teke ede God moglmara omga i, ye promismo ake gi di moraiglmedi deno muduno si gigle di norukwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19-20" />Ana God nono ere wakai ere noragle dugwa ka i, nono ye kaima erabukra we di prumga pre ka i nono si gigle di norukwa. Sip pai morabedi anka pia si nigle edigo, sip dumo swara ta pai moglmere yegl, God nono ere norabra we di prumgo, nono si gigle di norukwa. Te, Jisas, okuo nono ye ere wakai ere norabedi pre gi dumga yagle moglkwa i, ye ede okna heven ibo pidre, ake ple di noro moglkwa. Tawa teigwa yoba bitno yagl God yugumo suna, lap kogl kegl dimara ede aket pidre, dumo mawagl podo pamara omere mere yegl, ye ede heven suna pidre, ake ple di noro moglkwa. Jisas ye yagl Melkisedek okna tawa togwa yagl moglmere yegl, nono tawano togwa bitno yagl aimadi kamin morabuka.<verse eid="HEB 6:19-20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Yagl Melkisedek okna moglkwa i, Jisas tawano togwa yagle okuo morabuka i, piksa mere yegl i nogugl edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Ana yagl Melkisedek ikra pre ka tau dinaglka. Ye okna ibo dumo Salem we dimara i, ye kingno moglsre, te God mogl mitna kaima edugwa i, tawa togwa yagle ama moglkwa. Abraham ege swara ta king tau kuda bogl te kodidre, ede ikne ugo, ye Melkisedek bogl tegigl yebriko, Melkisedek ye Abraham mogl pai erabara u wakai enabedi God kagie mina di wakai yei togwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Di wakai yei togo, Abraham bona gana mudu kuda mina yugwa i, yubu si bage 10-pela edidre, bage swara ta Melkisedek togwa. Ana yagl i kagie Melkisedek mem paugwa i, king ta mabuno du erukwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, dumo Salem kagie mem paugwa i, deno muduno wida dugwa mere yegl paugwa. Yegl pre Melkisedek king ta dem muduo wida dugwa mere yegl moglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Ana God kamo bage ta Melkisedek pre dugwa i, ye nem mo mam mo kowamo awamo ira meglkwa i pre ka swara ta dikrukwa. Te, ye mam aunake ye kuglkwa mo ye aunake goglkwa pre ama dikrukwa. Yegl pre ka ebrie ta dinaglka i, Melkisedek ye God Wam mere yegl moglsre, tawa togwa yagle aimadi kamin moglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Ana Melkisedek siragl mere yagl kade moglkwa i, ene prio. Nono kowano awano Abraham i, ye yoba kade ta moglkwa ba ye bona gana tau yugwa i, br 10-pela boglsre, swara ta Melkisedek tomara i mina nono kanamga, Melkisedek ye Abraham moglmara mogl mitna ede togwa pamedi kanamga.<verse eid="HEB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ana God lomo dugwa i, Israel yoba, ye mudu Abraham gawama meglkwa i, taragl ta ere nenaiglkwa i, br 10-pela boglsre, br swara ta ye agroma, Livai yoba tawa teigwa yoba meglkwa i, tenaiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl pre Israel yoba meglmara i, Livai yoba tau mogl mitna edigwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6-7" />Ana Melkisedek moglkwa i, Livai yoba ta moglkre, yugobuno pere ta moglkwa ba Abraham ere mogl, ye br swara ta togwa paugwa. Tomara i mina Melkisedek ye Abraham moglmara mogl mitna ede tomedi pramga. Prio. Abraham God promismo mudu i kodugwa ba Melkisedek aglke kor Abraham di wakai yei te, ta i tebe edugwa i, Melkisedek yagl kade kaima ta moglkwa pai dugwa. I siragl pre nono mudu pre pogl sumga i, yoba kade keme yoba yoko kamageno ersre, di wakai yei tenaiglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Ana Livai yoba Israel yoba taraglno ya migeno ikne ta igwa i, ye bugla yugu tau nedre, geglkwa. Ba Melkisedek, ye Abraham taraglmo tau yugwa i, God kamo ye goglmiwe ta dikrukwa pre ye kor mogl pai moglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Te, Livai yoba ye Israel taraglno mina br swara ta igwa i, ye kowano Livai ama Abraham erumara i mina Melkisedek br ta togwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Yagl Livai Abraham yugobunomo mina okuo unabuka pre Livai moglkrukwa igne, ye kowamo Abraham ere mogl, Melkisedek br ta tomara i, i swara ede togwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas tawano togwa yagle i, ye tawa teigwa yoba okna meglkwa i, mudu egre togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Ana Livai yoba ye tawa teigwa yoba mogl, kogon eriko, God lomo gigledi paugwa ba ye kogon erimara i mina yoba u wakai kaima enaiglkwa i, kuno eruma, God ye tawa togwa yoba kor ta unabe dugwa i ta dikruko. Ba God tawa togwa yagl kor ta unabe dugwa i, Aron gawama meglmara suna i ta unabe dikrukwa. Yagl Melkisedek okna moglmere yegl mere, tawa togwa yagl kor ta unabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Ana tawa togwa yagl kor ta ugwa pre nono ama pramga i, lo okna paugwa i dudugo, ka kor ta ugwa pamedi pramga. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13-14" />I siragl pre nono prumga i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ye yagl Juda we digwa i gawamo ta moglkwa ba Moses lo boglkwa igne, ye Juda yoba tawa teigwa yoba moraiglme dikrukwa. Ye Livai yoba keme tawa teigwa yoba moraiglme dugwa pre Juda yoba okna kogon yegl ta erekrikwa. Ba erme Juda yagl ta nono tawano togwa yagle moglkwa pre lo okna ikra dudugo, ka kor ta ugwa pamedi pramga.<verse eid="HEB 7:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Ana God lomo ikra dudugo, ka kor ta ume diga i, nogugl kaima paugwa. I siragl pre Melkisedek moglmere mere yegl, tawa togwa yagl kor ta unabe dugwa ikra, u kodugwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ye tawa togwa yagl moglkwa i, lo dumere yegl, tawa togwa yagl ta moglkrukwa. Lo dugwa i, Livai gawama ta meglkwa i keme tawa teigwa yoba moraiglme dugwa. Ba Jisas tawa togwa yagl moglkwa i, ye yobuglomo podo paugo, aimadi kamin kor morabuka moglkwa pre ye u tawa togwa yagl ogwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />God kamo Jisas pre dugwa i, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">Yagl Melkisedek ye okna tawa narukwa yoba moglmere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">Ene tawa natnga yoba aimadi moratne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:17">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18-19" />Ana God lomo okna paugwa i, yoba u wakai enaiglmedi ake ple di norabuka i, yobuglomo paikrukwa pre God ye lomo i, i eglke edidre, taragl kor inaiglmedi padigl norukwa. Taragl kor i, lo egre atne edugwa, te taragl kor i mina God moglmara mogl magigl edumnedi prumga.<verse eid="HEB 7:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Te, Jisas ye u tawano togwa yagle moglkwa i, ye kogon i yoko ta ikrukwa ba God ka gigledi ta di paduglmara i mina kogon i yugwa. Livai yoba okna tawa teigwa yoba meglkwa i, God ka gigledi ta di paduglmara i mina kogon i ta ikrikwa <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />ba God ye Jisas pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Na Yagl Kade moglka i, ka gigledi di padiglsre, nomane kor ta ikraglka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Ene tawa natnga yoba aimadi moratniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 7:21">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />God ka yegl di paduglkwa pre nono pre pogl sinamga i, Jisas adigl gigledi mogl, ka kor ta yudre, di norukwa i, God lomo, ye okna di paduglkwa i, egre atne edumedi pramga.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ana okna tawa teigwa yoba mere kide meglkwa. I siragl pre yoba swara ta tawa togwa yoba aimadi morabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Ye mudu bugla yugu tau moglsre, geglko, yoba pere u ye againo igwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ba Jisas ye tawano togwa yagl moglkwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka pre yoba ta u ye agaimo ta ikraiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Te, ye aimadi kamin nono tawano togwa yagle morabuka pre yoba ye mina ede God moglmara enaiglkwa i, ye ege swara ere inan, aimadi kamin wakai kaima moraiglkwa i, kuno erukwa. I siragl pre ye aimadi kamin kor moglsre, God yoba i ake ple di tenabedi kamage ere moglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Ana tawa teigwa bitno yoba wakai kaima ta moran, ake ple di norabuka kuno erabuka. Jisas yegl mere moglsre, ye dem muduo pe sugo, aglau swara ta erekrukwa. Te, ye mabuno deglbi yogwa i ta erekrukwa. God ye i pere edidre, heven ibo morabedi edugo, ye tadaglme yoba meglmara suna moglkrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Tawa teigwa yoba okna meglkwa i, ye ege ege tawa tenaiglkwa paugwa. Komno kana ye yene tadaglmeno pre tawa tedre, okuo yoba pere tadaglmeno pre tawa teigwa ba Jisas yegl ta erabuka i ta paikrukwa. Ye yene ege swara ta i pi God togwa i, ye tawa te kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ana God lomo yoba tau tawa teigwa yoba bitno moraiglme dugwa i, yoba yoko, ye yobuglno ta paikrukwa i kogon yegl eraiglkwa pre dugwa. Ba lo ugo, mokomugl i, God promis kor ta ere, tawa togwa bitno yoba kor ta unabiwe dugwa i, God yene Wam pre dugwa. God Wam u wakai kaima pidre, ye swara nono ake ple di norabuka. Noran, aimadi kamin yegl morabuka.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Jisas nono tawano togwa yagle moglsre, heven ibo moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Ka yegl dumga i, mem kade ta paugwa pre dumga. Mem i, yegl paugwa, Jisas nono tawano togwa yagl kade moglkwa. Ye heven ibo pidre, God Mogl Mitna Kaima edugwa i, ogo wo kra ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Te, ye erme sel yugu ta God yugumo kaima yomara dumo mawagl pamara i, yugugl kra God kogonmo ere moglkwa. Sel yugu kaima i, yoba ta keikrikwa ba Yagl Kade yene kegwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Ana tawa teigwa bitno yoba meglkwa i, ye ofa ya tawa tenaiglkwa i kogono paugwa. Ama Jisas nono tawano togwa yagl kade moglkwa pre ye tawa ta tenabuka paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Te, Jisas makandigle mogl pai moglma, ye tawa togwa yagl ta moglkruko. I siragl pre makandigle yoba lo dumere mere tawa te meglkwa i, ye mogl kodigwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ba ye kogon erimara yugu i, God yugumo kaima heven ibo yogwa i, piksamo mere yegl keme yogwa. Ana God yugumo makandigle yogwa i, piksa yogwa pre Moses sel yugu i kenagledi erukwa igne, God ye ka gigle di tedre, yegl di togwa, Ene sel yugu ta kedre, taragl kane kane ta bekenatnga i, na ene muglo ibo motnga igne obuno di teimere yegl keme kedre, bekidre, eragledi kan kun ero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 25.40</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">God promis kor di paduglkwa i, pai mitna ede, promis okna di te paduglkwa i, egrukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ana God heven ibo Jisas kogon ta togo, ere moglkwa i, kogon podo padre, tawa teigwa yoba makandigle kogon erikwa i, egre atne edugwa. I siragl pre promis kor ta God nono di padigl norumara i, Jisas ye God moglmara ya yoba munara suna moglsre, ake ple di noro moglkwa. Ana God promis kor erme di padigl norukwa i, kamo wakai kaima paugwa pre i win sidre, ka okna ibo di paduglkwa togwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Ana ene prio. God ka okna di te paduglkwa i wakai kaima pama, God ye ka kor ta di te padragle dugwa i ta dikruko. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ba nono kowano awanoma ye God lomo si biglke digwa i, God kide kandre, ye kamo mina yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Yagl Kade dugwa i, yegl dugwa. Ene kanio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Israel yoba ya Juda yoba meglmara i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">okuo na ka kor ta di te padraglka.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ka kor i, na okna ta ye kowano awanoma di te padiglmere yegl ta paikrabiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">I siragl pre ye kowano awanoma dumo Isip mogl dinaiglmedi ogono akidre, auro i ede eiga igne i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">na ye ka ta di te padiglka ba na di te padiglmere yegl, ye duglo boglkrikwa pre na ye mokona teiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 31.31-32</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 8:9">di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Yagl Kade ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Na okuo Israel yoba promis kor ta di te padraglka i, yegl mere panabuka, Na lona ye nomano ya deno muduno mina suna padragliwa. Te, na ye Godno moglbo, ye na yobanama moraiglmiwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Te, igne i yoba tau ye kabagleno ya agroma ka di te, Ene Yagl Kade pre kan erio! di, yegl ta dikraiglkwa. I siragl pre yoba kade ya yoba yoko i pra, mudu na ira moglka i, pre kan ere kodinaiglkwa pre ka yegl ta dikraiglmiwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />I siragl pre na ye mitno goglsre, mabunono kide ya tadaglmeno pre moglkraluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 31.33-34</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 8:12">di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Ana God ye ka kor ta di te padragle dugwa igne, ye ka okna di te paduglkwa i, u goglo enabuka mere yegl i nogugl edugwa. Ana taragl ta u goglo ogwa i, imim darabuka i, magigl erukwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yoba sipsip ya ki si goglsre, tawa teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Ana God ye ka okna di te paduglkwa igne, yoba ye kogonmo siragl mere eraiglkwa i pre ye didre, ye yugumo makandigle yenabuka i pre ama dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Yugu i, sel yugu ta yogwa. Te, sel yugu i, lap suna koglsre, ere i bage suo edigwa. Bage ta nogugl yogwa i, dumo mawagl pamara we digwa. Dumo i mina ken lam yogo, bogl ta ama yogwa. Bogl i mina ye bret tau God gumuglo mina yeigwa yogwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Te, lap kogl kegl dimara aket kra i, dumo mawagl podo pamara we digwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Dumo i pre bogl kebra ta gol mina bekigwa i yogo, ye bogl i mina ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i gaiglkwa. Te, dumo i mina God ka di te paduglkwa boksmo ikra yogwa. Boks i, ye gol koglo koglo si dage padiglsre, taragl suota atne yeigwa. Taragl swara ta atne yeigwa i, sin ta gol mina bekigo, taragl mana we digwa ikra tau sin i mina atne yogwa. Te, taragl ta atne yeigwa i, Aaron muglbomo kie sugwa i yeigwa. Te, taragl ta, kobuglo paglkane suo, God ye ka di te paduglkwa i, kobuglo i mina boglkwa ikra, atne yeigwa yogwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Te, boks pre, God yoba tadaglmeno si bi dinagle dumara tebe i, God yene moragle dugwa. God yene moragle dumara i, yoba angelo gigledi suo ta miurka i kiano koglo koglo beke padiglsre, ye koyeno boks pre mina ake pigla di miurka mere yegl beke padiglkwa. Ana taragl swara swarade sel yugu mina atne yogwa i pre mudu ta erme dinaglka i, kuno ta erekrabuka.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ana sel yugu yegl mere kei padigl kodigo, tawa teigwa yoba ege ege ede pi lap kogl kegl dimara nogugl ikra pidre, God kogonmo ere meglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ba lap kogl kegl dimara aket kra, dumo mawagl podo pamara ikra, bugla yugu swara swarade, ege swara keme tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, ede yugugl ogwa. Te, ye ede yugugl ogwa i, yoko ta pikrukwa ba ye bormai kogl idre, ede ogwa. Bormai i, ye yene tadaglmemo pre God tedre, Israel yoba tadaglme ta pre kan erekrisre, erikwa i pre ama togwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba kogon ere pai meglmara mina Mudu Murubuglo taragl ta obuno dugwa. Ye obuno dugwa i, tawa teigwa yugu kogonmo dudukrukwa pre yoba yoko ede dumo mawagl podo pamara ikra enaiglkwa kuno erekrumedi obuno dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Te, erme obuno dumara i mina yoba nomane inaiglkwa. Tawa ya ofa kane kane teimara i mina ta ake ple di norokrumedi i nogugl edugo, erme tadaglmeno pai moglmedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Ye deno muduno mina tadaglmeno pai moglmedi praiglkwa i, siragl pre God lomo okna dugwa i, taragl meda yogwa i keme pre dugwa. Yoba kaya mokna siragl mere nenaiglkwa ya nigl siragl mere nenaiglkwa ya yoba nigl panaiglkwa ya taragl yegl mere pre dugwa. Taragl i ogono nagino keme pre dugwa God togwa ba ege ta unan, God ere i kor ede, i kuno ede tenabuka.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krais yene bormaimo suru edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ana Krais ugwa igne, ye tawano togwa yagle moglsre, taragl wakai wakai okuo unabuka i, noragle dugwa. Ye tawano togwa yagle moglsre, yoba ogono mina sel yugu ta makandigle kei yeimara i, ede yugugl pikrukwa. Ye sel yugu wakai kaima ta heven ibo yomara i, ede yugugl ogwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Te, ye ede yugugl ogwa igne, meme ya kau nagigle ya ki ta bormaino idre, ede yugugl pikrukwa ba ye yene bormaimo mina ede dumo mawagl podo pamara pidre, nono aimadi kamin kor moraiglmedi topo sugwa. Te, ye ege mere ede yugugl pikrukwa ba ege swara kaima ta omara i, nono topo si kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Ana God gumuglo mina yoba ta deglbi yeigwa igne, tawa teigwa yoba ere mogl, meme bormaino idre, kau kumugl bormaino idre, kau abai ta si gagl tege erikwa i, nir idre, yoba i mina si plai sigo, ye ogono nagino meda i, u wakai eigwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Ba Krais bormaimo i, taragl yegl mere mudu egre atne edidre, nagino swara ere wakai erekrukwa. Bormaimo nono lo duglo boglsre, gogl dinaiglmedi ere wakai ersre, te God kor aimadi moglkwa kogonmo ere pai moraiglmedi ere wakai ere norukwa. Krais aglaumo swara ta paikruko, Mudu Murubuglo aimadi moglkwa i yobuglo tomara mina ye yene i pi God tawa togwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ana nono God bogl u swara pi, akie si dakagl moramga i pre Jisas suna wom adigl mogl, ka kor aimadi panabedi bo buko dugwa. Okna i, yoba tadaglme ersre, lo komono paugwa i, si biglki digo, Jisas goglsre, kumapno togwa. Yegl pre God di gaglkwa yoba okuo taragl wakai wakai ye inaiglmedi di paduglkwa i, inaiglkwa kuno kaima erukwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16-17" />Ana yoba ta ere mogl, Na goglbo, gagrama na taraglna yegl yegl inaiglmedi prabuka i, ye ka gigledi di padiglsre, pepa mina bogl atne edenabuka. Ba ye goran, ye pepa boglmere yegl inaiglkwa. Ye kor moran, ye ka boglkwa i, yobuglomo ta paikrabuka.<verse eid="HEB 9:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ana God promis komono di te paduglkwa i, ama yoko ta paikrukwa ba bormai suru edigo, gigledi paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />God lomo dumere yegl, Moses ye lo mudu Israel yoba kere te kodugwa igne, ye kau nagro bormaino tau idre, meme bormaino tau idre, nigl kor bogl toide i swara edidre, ede ta hisop we digwa i yogagle tau idre, kan gogl mina toguma si, bormai ya nigl mina i atne edidre, buk kerukwa i ya yoba meglkwa i mina si plai si edugwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Si plai si edidre, yoba i yegl di togwa, Ene ya God bogl ikne ikne kamo duglo boraiglme dugwa i, promis i bormai i mina si gigle dumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 24.8</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Te, sel yugu ya taragl mudu ta yugugl yogo, yoba idre, God kogonmo eraiglkwa i, Moses kuno yegl mere bormai taragl i mina si plai sugwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Ana God lomo dumere kuno yegl taragl tau mudu bormai keme ere i wakai edugwa mere yegl pamedi kamga. Te, bormai suru edigo keme God ye tadaglmeno kide kodo togwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Ana bormai mina u wakai enabuka pre sel yugu makandigle yogwa i ya taragl kane kane heven ibo yomere piksano mere yegl yogwa i, kau ya meme bormaino mina u wakai enaiglkwa keme paugwa. Ba taragl heven ibo yeigwa i, tawa wakai kaima ta mina u wakai enaiglkwa keme paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Ana sel yugu yoba ogono mina keigwa i, God yugumo kaima ta yekrukwa ba God yugumo kaima yogwa i, piksamo mere yegl yogwa. Krais ye sel yugu makandigle yogwa i mina ede yugugl pikrukwa ba ede heven kaima ibo pidre, erme God gumuglo mina nono kano di moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, ye bugla yugu swara swarade dumo mawagl podo pamara i, yugugl pidre, taragl pere bormaino tomere yegl, Krais ye yene ege mere tenagledi heven ibo pikrukwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Krais ye yegl ta erabuka pama, God dumo makan ere yogwa igne ede u erme pra, Krais ege mere udre, ege mere goglko. Ba erme, taragl mudu dudunabuka magigl erukwa igne, Krais ege swara kaima udre, tadaglme si dudu kodinagledi ye yene togwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />God di paduglkwa i, yoba ege swara keme goglsre, okuo ye kotmo mina adraiglmedi di paduglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Kuno yegl mere, Krais ege swara keme yoba mere kide tadaglmeno idre, tawano tenagledi ye yene togwa. Te, ye okuo ege namba 2 unabuka i, yoba tadaglmeno gugl edenagledi pre ukrabuka ba yoba ye unabedi kie ere meglkwa i, ere inan, wakai kaima moraiglkwa i pre unabuka.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Krais tawano ege swara te kodugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ana taragl wakai okuo unabuka i, God lomo ta manugwa. I piksa keme yogwa. Yegl pre bugla yugu yomere yomere yoba lo dumere ersre, ege swarade pi tawa teigwa ba ye erimara i mina du moglkrikwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ana yoba ye ege swara tawa teimara i, God ye tadaglmeno gugl ede toma, no tadaglmeno ta pai moglkrumedi prisre, tawa okuo ta tekriko. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ba mabuno yegl ta paikrukwa. Ye bugla yugu swara swarade tawa te meglkwa igne, ye tadaglmeno pai moglmedi poglo di prikwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />I siragl pre kau ya meme bormaino i, yoba tadaglmeno ta gugl edenan, kuno erekrabuka.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Yegl pre Krais ede makandigle ugwa igne, ye God yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">Yoba ene ofa ya tawa kane kane teigwa i, ene wakai ta prikitnga pre</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">Na ogona nagna panabedi prisre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">Ogona nagna ere wakai ere yei natnga.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Yoba tawa tau mudu gagl tege erikwa i ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">tawa tau ye tadaglmeno pre teigwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">Ene kandre, gun yeikitnga.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Yegl pre God yo, na ene yegl di teiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">Kano, yoba ene kanen mina bogl atne edimere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Ene na ta erabedi pitnere mere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">Na eragledi wiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 40.6-8</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:7">di, Krais yegl dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Ana Krais ka yegl dumara i mina ye komono kana dugwa i, Yoba ofa ya tawa kane kane teigwa i, ene wakai kankre, tawa tau mudu gagl tege erikwa i ya, tawa tau tadaglmeno pre teigwa i, ene kandre, gun yeikitniwe dugwa. God lomo dumere mere yoba taragl i teigwa ba God kandre, wakai prikrukwa pre dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Ye yegl didre, okuo dugwa i, Kano, ene na ta erabedi pitnere eragledi wiwe dugwa. Krais ka yegl dumara i mina nono pramga i, yoba tawa okna teigwa mabuno i, Krais si dudidre, yene kogon erumara i mina mabuno kor i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Te, God Jisas Krais ta erabedi prumere mere yegl, ye yene ogo nagie nono tawano pre ege swara kaima te kodugo, nono erme God gumuglo mina yoba du munga.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Priest lifting a bowl" file="hk00273b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="10.11">Tawa Teigwa Yoba tawa teimara tadaglmeno koko edekrukwa</figure>Ana tawa teigwa yoba mudu meglkwa i, ye ege ege kogono ersre, tawa ege mere kaima kuno ere te pai meglkwa. Yegl erikwa ba ye erimara i mina yoba tadaglmeno ta gugl edibi, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ba Krais ege swara kaima yoba tadaglmeno pre tawa swara te kodidre, ede heven ibo pi, God ogo wo kra ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Ye God ogo wo kra ame di moglsre, na kudana ikne meglkwa i, God ye mudu yu, kaglna mina atne edenabedi sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />I siragl pre ye tawa swara kaima tomara i mina ye yoba ta ere i du edugwa meglkwa i, aimadi kamin wakai kaima moraiglmedi ere ede kodugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Ana mem swara i pre Mudu Murubuglo okna ka ta di norukwa, <verse eid="HEB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />Yagl Kade yegl dugwa, Na okuo ere mogl, Israel yoba promis kor ta di te padraglka i, yegl mere panabuka, Na lona ye nomano ya deno muduno mina suna padragle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 31.33</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Ye yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ye mabunono kide ya tadaglmeno pre moglkraluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 31.34</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Ana God yoba ta tadaglmeno gugl ede te kodugwa meglkwa i, ye tadaglmeno pre tawa kor ta tenaiglkwa i ta paikrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas mina nono ede God moglmara magigl enamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, Jisas bormaimo suru edumara i mina nono kudugl goglkre, ede pi dumo mawagl podo pamara enamga kuno erukwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />I siragl pre Jisas yene ogo nagie mina goglmara i, ye nono u kor pidre, lap podo kogl kegl dimara ede aket enaiglmedi, konbauna kor yauro norukwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Te, Jisas erme nono tawano togwa yagle moglsre, God yobama mudu bitno mogl, suglno moglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Yegl pre nono deno muduno mina kaima prisre, Jisas ka kaima pre medigl mogl, ede God moglmara magigl enamga paugwa. I siragl pre nono mabunono kide dudumedi praiglmedi Jisas yene bormaimo nono mina si plai sidre, God gumuglo mina nono deglbi yei dinaiglmedi nigl wakai kaima ta mina nono nigl pai norukwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Nono God ka kaima taragl wakai wakai noragle dume dumga i, nono ka i kide kodokre, ake gi di moramga paugwa. I siragl pre God promis ta erabuka i, ye erabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Te, nono siragl mere agrama abarama wagle wakai kandre, mabuno wakai boramga i, nono wakai ere kinano gudu prisre, ka di pre eramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba tau ye yene akie makai sinaiglkwa i, kide kodigwa ba nono mabuno yegl ta erekramga paugwa. Nono akie makai sinamga paugwa. Te, Yaglno Kade ede ikne unabuka magigl erukwa pre nono kogon podo ersre, deno muduno ikne ikne si gigle di tenamga.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krais kamo kide kodokramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />I siragl pre nono Krais kamo kaima paugwa i, pre kan ere kodo, mane di tedre, tadaglme ere pai mun, nono tadaglmeno tawamo tenamga i, swara ta yeikrabuka. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Yeikran, God no sinabukra we di prisre, kudugl goramga paugwa. Te, God kubrisre, ye kudamo ikne doga mina si garabere mere yegl, nono ama ka tage norabiwe di prisre, kudugl gogl moramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />God lomo okna Moses togwa i, yoba ta ere mogl, ye lomo sedugo, yoba suo mo suota ye mabuno kide erukwa i kandre, u digo, yoba ye mirie goglkre, si geglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Yoba God lomo sedigwa i, yubun yegl igwa pre ene siragl we di prime? Yoba ta God Wam moko tedre, ye bormaimo i taragl yoko mere yegl yomedi pran, ye yubun kebra dagl ta inabo mo yubun podo inabe? Podo inabuka. Jisas bormaimo i mina God ka kor ta di noro paduglkwa i plau dugo, yoba i Jisas bormaimo i mina ama God gumuglo mina ye du moglkwa ba ye aglke kor Jisas moko tedre, God Murubuglomo, yoko kaima ere wakai ere noro moglkwa i, ka kide di togwa mere yegl paugwa pre ye kaima yubun podo inabuka.<verse eid="HEB 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Ana God yubun norabe diga i, ene prio. Nono Godno, nono ye pre kan erumga i, okna yegl dugwa, Yoba mabuno kide ta eraiglkwa i, nana ere te ikne edenagliwa. I na kogona pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.35</char></note> dugwa. Te, ye kamo mina ama yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade moglkwa i, ye yobama ka tage tenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.36</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Kor aimadi moglkwa God i, yoba ta si akenan, ye kudugl podo kaima gorabuka.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Ana ene okna God abuglage koragle si togwa igne i ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, poglo di prio! Igne i, yoba ene yubun podo teigo, ene giugl prikwa ba ene adigl gigledi mogl pai meglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Ege tau yoba gumuglnomugl ene ka kide di tedre, ere kide ere teigwa. Ege tau ye yoba pere yubun yegl teigo, ene yubun igwa yobamo i bogl si dakagl moglsre, ake ple di teigwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Ye ene agroma tau si kane sigwa igne, ene agroma kane paigwa i, mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere teigwa. Te, ye ene taraglno kunogl i ede eigwa igne, ene gun yedre, pra we digwa. I siragl pre ene prikwa i, taragl wakai wakai okuo inamga i, makandigle taragl i win si tedre, aimadi kamin yenabedi prikwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ana okna ene mabuno yegl ersre, adigl gigledi meglkwa pre erme yoba ene ere kide ta ere tebi, ene pre mediglkwa i kide kodokre, God no ere wakai ere norabukra we di pre pai molo. I siragl pre ene yegl pre pai meglbi, ene topo podo okuo inaiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Ene kaima adigl gigledi moraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre God ene ta eraiglmedi prumere yegl, ene eribi, ye taragl wakai wakai ene tenagledi promis di te paduglkwa i, ene inaiglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ene prio! Nono kuri ta mun, Yoba ta unabuka paugwa i, sugl moglkre, unabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 26.20</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Te, God kamo dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Na yoba ta du mogl kodumedi kaniga i, ye pre medigl pai morabuka paugwa. Ba ye pre meduglkwa i ta kide kodinan, na kiana mina gun yeikragle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Habakuk 2.4</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ba yoba pre mediglkwa i kide kodo, ye u kide eimere mere yegl, nono yegl ta moglkrumnedi prika. Nono pre medigl pai mun, u kide pikre, wakai moramga mere yegl munedi prika.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa mabuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Nono pre medunga i, mabuno yegl paugwa, God taragl tau noragle dugwa i, nono gumuglno mina ta kankrumga ba ye kaima dumedi prisre, norabukra we di prumga. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Te, kowano awano okna ibo meglkwa i, ye God kamo yegl mere pre mediglkwa pre God ye wakai kanugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Nono pre medunga pre nono pre kan erumga i, God ye ka dumara i mina taragl kane kane ere yomedi prumga. Taragl kane kane makandigle paigo, nono gumuglno mina kamga i, ta idre, taragl kane kane i ta beke yeikrukwa ba ye ka dumara mina ye plau digo, erme kamga.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba okna ibo God pre mediglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ana Abel okna moglkwa i, ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye tawa kuno ere yu togwa. Ye tawa togwa i, wakai yogo, agigle Kein tawa togwa i, wakai yeikrukwa. Ana ye pre meduglmara i pre God ye yagl du moglmiwe didre, ye tawa togwa i kuno erume dugwa. Te, Abel okna ibo goglkwa ba ye pre meduglkwa mabuno i mina ka di noro moglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Ana Enok ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye kor moglko, God ye gagie kia bogl i ede heven ogo, yoba okuo ye ta kankrikwa. Te, God kamo dugwa i, Enok ye makandigle moglkwa igne, God ye Enok wakai kanume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 5.24</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Ana yoba ta God pre mediglkran, God ye wakai ta kankrabuka. I siragl pre yoba ta God moglmara mogl magigl edenagledi prabuka i, ye taragl suo erabuka. Ye God moglmedi pre mediglsre, te, ka kaima God dokumun, God topo wakai norabukra we di, ama pre medrabuka paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Noa ye God pre meduglkwa pre God taragl tau plau dinabe dugwa igne, Noa God kuduglmo goglsre, ye ebie gagiglma gogl dinaiglmedi sip bekugwa. Ye nigl ta sugo, kankrukwa ba ye God pre meduglkwa pre bekugwa. Te, Noa pre meduglmara i mina ye makandigle yoba mudu meglkwa i, kide erimedi i nogugl edugo, God ye pre meduglmara i, yagl du moglmedi kanugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Abraham ye God pre meduglkwa pre God Ene ede dumo bage ta po! dugwa igne, ye God kamo duglo boglsre, ede ogwa. Ye dumo kor i ta kankrukwa ba God dumo i ene makanen yenabe dugo, ye prisre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ana Abraham pi God dumo makan ta ye tenagle dumara i mina plau dugwa igne, ye God kamo pre medigl moglsre, ye yoba pere makano mina moglsre, sel yugu ere kipai moglkwa. Te, Aisak ya Jekop God dumo makan i tenagle dugwa ba ye ama sel yugu mina ere kipai miurka. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ana Abraham sel yugu ere kipai moglkwa i, ye siti ta gigledi kaima yenabuka i mina okuo moragledi pre moglkwa. Siti i siragl mere yenabuka i, God yene pre epigl ersre, ere kei moglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ana Sara ama God pre meduglkwa. Ye kidagl yei kodugwa pre gak ta kuglkrabuka mere yegl paugwa ba God, ye gak ta kuratniwe di, promis erukwa i, ye kamo mina adigl morabukra we di prukwa pre God ye ake ple di togo, ye gak ta kuglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Yegl pre yagl Abraham swara i mina yoba mere plau digwa. Ye kidagl yedre, gorabuka magigl erukwa mere yegl paugwa ba ye gawama okuo mogl wigwa i, kugl kuri mere kide paimere yegl, mere kide moglsre, pi kaugl mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Ana yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, ye God pre medigl moglsre, geglkwa. Te, God ye taragl tau tenagle di paduglkwa i, ye makandigle meglkwa igne i ta ikrikwa ba ye eglke mogl, kan iro ede kanigwa mere yegl paugwa. Ye taragl tau okuo inaiglkwa i kandre, gun yeigwa. Te, ye ka ta di nogugl edigwa i, makandigle yoba moglkrumga ba dumo pere nem munga mere yegl pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Ana yoba ka yegl mere ta digwa i, ye ka dimara i, ye dumono kaima ta dokigwa mere yegl i nogugl edigwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ana ene prio. Yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, ye dumo ta mogl, ede meda eimara i, poglo di pre ede ikne enamnedi pre eima, kuno eruko. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ba ye ede ikne enamnedi prikrikwa. Ye dumo ta wakai kaima yei, makandigle dumo egre atne edugwa i, inamnedi prikwa. Ye heven dumo ta inamnedi prikwa pre diga. Yegl pre yoba i ere mogl, God no Godno moglmiwe dinaiglkwa i, God agai ta goglkrukwa. I siragl pre God yene siti ta ye kipai moraiglmedi ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17-18" />Ana Abraham ye God pre meduglkwa pre God ye ta eran kanagledi ka di togwa igne, ye wam swara Aisak i, si gogl, God tawa tenagledi erukwa. God ye okna Aisak pre dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene gawanma mere kide moraiglme diga ikra we, Aisak swara wama ya gawama pre die<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17-18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 21.12</char></note> dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Abraham God di tomere mere ye si goragledi erukwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abraham prukwa i, na wana si goglbo, God ye ere i kor edenabuka i, kuno erumedi prukwa. Te, ka ebrie mere yegl dinamga i, Aisak goglko, God ye Abraham te ikne edugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Aisak ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye wam suo Jekop ya Iso di wakai yei tedre, siragl taragl ye miurara okuo plau dinabuka i, di pogl togwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Jekop ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye goragledi erukwa igne, ye Josep wam suo di wakai yei tedre, bre i pi muglbomo mina tebe yei, magididre, God kagie kade togwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Josep ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye goragledi erukwa igne, ye Israel yoba okuo dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmiwe di tedre, Na yobra dumo Isip i yei dinabiwa. Ene enaiglmara idre, ede pio dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Moses nem mam suo God pre mediurka pre ye Moses kiurka igne, ye ba suota mere yegl, teke padiurka. I siragl pre ye gak wakai kaima ta moglmedi kandre, ye king lomo si bugl dinabrika i, ama kudugl ta goglkribrika.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Moses ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye kade moglkwa igne, yoba ye Isip king abuglo wam moglmiwe dinaiglkwa i, ye mane dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Ye Isip yoba bogl tadaglme eribi, ege sugunagle ta gun yenabuka i, mane didre, God yobama bogl yubun akie inamnedi prukwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />I siragl pre ye prukwa i, Isip yoba mige moni ya bonagana mere kan neigwa i, taragl kebra yomedi prukwa ba ye Krais pre yubun inabuka i, wakai panabedi prukwa. I siragl pre ye topo okuo inabuka i, poglo di prukwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Ana Moses ye God pre meduglkwa pre ye ama Israel yoba auro i ede enan, Isip king dem kubrabuka i ye kudugl ta goglkre, auro i ede ogwa. Nono gumuglno mina God moglkwa i ta kankrumga ba Moses ye God siragl mere moglkwa i, kaima pre kan ersre, adigl gigledi mogl, kogon erukwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" /><figure style="fig" file="CO00810b.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="11.28" />Te, ye pre meduglmara i pre God ye Israel yoba oglo sinagle dugwa igne, ye God dumere mere Israel yoba yegl di togwa, Angelo ta wan u ikne ikne pidre, yoba wano komono si gorabuka i, ene wano komono ama si gogl dinabedi sipsip ya meme si gogl, bormaino yugu guglo mina egrio dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Israel yoba ye God pre mediglkwa pre ye mudi nigl Retsi moglmara ede koglo eigwa igne, makan kugla dugwa ye egre ede eigwa. Ba Isip yoba ede suna wigwa igne, ye nigl nedre, geglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ana Israel yoba God pre mediglkwa pre ye ama dumo Jeriko wigwa igne, ye ege 7-pela de taun i kobuglo togl erimara egre winabo digo, kobuglo togl i, gurdi yage atne sugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Rahap, ye konbauna abu ta moglkwa i, God pre meduglkwa pre Israel yagl suo dumo Jeriko doko daka ere kanabugledi ubrika i, ye i yugugl edidre, ake ple di togo, okuo Jeriko yoba ye God kamo sedigwa i, geglkwa igne, ye ta goglkrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ana na yoba tau mere pre ama dinaglka ba ege ta yeikrukwa. Na Gideon ya Barak ya Samson ya Jepta ya Devit ya Samuel ya God kamo kep yoba okna meglkwa i pre mudu ta dibo, kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Ye God pre mediglkwa pre ye king tau kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. Te, ye mabuno du erikwa. Te, God ye taragl tau tenagledi promis erukwa i, ye igwa. Te, ye laion drano si kegl digwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, ye pre mediglmara taragl yegl mere ersre, te, yoba ege tau doga podo ere gaglsre, ye gagl tege eramnedi erikwa igne, ye dekrikwa. Te, ege tau yoba bainet mina ye si goramnedi eriko, ye teke ede eigwa. Ye yobuglno paikrumara i, God yobuglo bogl togo, ye kuda mina yobuglo ersre, yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, amino yobuglo ere teigo, ami i teke ede eigwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Ana yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, ye pre mediglkwa pre God ye taragl kane kane ere togwa. Abu tau, gagroma geglkwa ba ye pre mediglmara i, God ye ere i kor edugo, meglkwa. Ba pre mediglkwa yoba okna meglkwa i, ye tau mere ama yubun igwa. Tau yoba si kane sidre, ye yegl di teigwa, Ene God pre mediglkwa i kide kodibi, ede meda enaiglmiwe digwa. Ba pre mediglkwa yoba i, ye yegl eraiglkwa i, mane digwa. I siragl pre ye prikwa i, pre medunga i ta kide kodokrumun, adigl u kor enamga igne, topo wakai kaima inamnedi prikwa. Yegl pre ye ede meda enakiuro, mane digo, yoba ye gagno giugl podo tedre, si geglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Te, pre mediglkwa yoba tau yoba ye kenaglno sidre, duglnai sigwa. Te, tau si kane si i pi kane yugu edigwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Tau, yoba kobuglo sidre, si geglko, tau yoba so idre, ogono nagino suna wom si bugl digo, tau bainet mina si geglkwa. Te, tau kuguglno gaglno ki ta manugo, ye sipsip nagino ya meme nagino keme ede wan meglkwa. Tau kaya mokna ya ki manugo, yoba ye ere kide ere teigo, ye yubun igwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Ye dumo wau yomara ya muglo meglbi ki wan moglsre, kobuglo mur ya makan mur yomara atne kwi pai wan meglkwa. Pre mediglkwa yoba i, makadigle yoba meglmere mere yegl ta moglkrikwa. Ye mabunono wakai pai, makandigle yoba mabunono egre i atne edugwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Ana yobamo i, ye mudu pre mediglmara i God wakai kanugwa ba God ye taragl tau tenagle dugwa i, ye kor meglkwa igne ikrikwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Ye ikrikwa i, God okuo taragl wakai wakai nono noragle dumara i, akie idre, ame wakai dinaiglmedi prukwa pre tabre ta tekrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Nono kan Jisas moglmara edinamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Yoba okna ibo pre mediglkwa i, mere kide mogl, nono mogl winabo didre, pre medramga mabuno i, i nogugl ede noriko, kamga. Yegl pre nono adigl gigledi mogl, God nono resis ta eraiglmedi padigl norukwa i, ere kodinamga paugwa. Taragl ta nono resis mina muku di dinaiglmedi erabuka taragl i, nono kide kodidre, tadaglme mabuno kigln mere yegl kogl paugwa i, nono si dinamnedi eramga paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Te, nono kan Jisas moglmara swara iro edidre, muku dinamga paugwa. Nono pre medramga i, Jisas mabuno moglsre, ere kodinabuka ama moglkwa. Jisas okuo gun podo yenagledi prukwa pre ye agai podo goglsre, ede prak mina gorabuka i, siragl kebra yomedi pra we dugwa. Pra we didre, erme God ogo wo kra ame di moglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">God ye gagiglma ere si di ake du edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Ana Jisas okna erumere i, ene poglo di prio. Tadaglme yoba ere mogl, Jisas kudamo ikne kaima moramnedi erikwa ba Jisas adigl gigledi mogl, pre wige erukwa. Ana Jisas erukwa i, ene poglo di pre meglbi, ene deno muduno mina oglka ta erekran, adigl gigledi moraiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Tadaglme mabuno no si atne ede dinabedi ene kuda mere yegl beglkwa ba ene kuda bogl pi bormaino suru edenaiglkwa pai moglkwa pre ene oglka ta erekrio.<verse eid="HEB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Ana God ye kamo mina ene deno muduno si gigle di tenagledi na gagrama yo dugwa i, ene kinano yom kana. Ye kamo i yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">Gagra yo, Yagl Kade ene ere si di ake du edenabuka i, taragl kebra yomedi prikro. Te, ye ene ka tenabuka i, ama kide prikro.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />I siragl pre Yagl Kade dem muduo togwa yobamo i, ye mabunono ake du ede tenabuka. Te, yoba ira ta na gagrama meglmedi kanugwa yobamo i, ye ere si di ake du edume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ame Wakai Digwa 3.11-12</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 12:6">dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Ana yubun ta ene meglmara unabuka igne i ene praiglkwa, God no mabunono ake du edenagledi erumedi prisre, adigl gigledi molo. Siragl pre God ene kanugwa i, na gagrama kra meglmedi kandre, ene ere si di yugwa. Ana nono kamga, nenoma mudu meglkwa i, ye gagroma ere si di igwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kuno yegl mere, God nono mudu si ake du edugwa ba ene ta ere si di ikran, ene pratnga, ye gagiglma meglmara suna i, na ta moglkriwa. Na konbauna gak mere yegl ta moliwedi pratnga. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Ana nono nenoma makandigle meglkwa i prio. Nono gak munga igne, nenoma nono ere si di igo, nono ye kano prisre, mogl atne edumga. Mogl atne edumnere yegl, God nono kiano Neno moglkwa i kamo prisre, mogl atne edinamga i, taragl podo paugwa. Nono yegl erumun, kor wakai moramga paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Nenoma makandigle meglkwa i, ye yene wakai primere, ege sugunagle nono mabunono ake du edinamnedi erikwa ba God nono ka kaima wakai moraiglmedi erukwa. Ye nono si ake du edenan, nono ye yoba du moglmere yegl moraiglmedi pre mabunono ake du edugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Ana God nono ta ere si di yugwa igne, nono deno muduno yubun dogo, kide prumga. Kide prumga ba okuo, nomane wakai imga. Nomane wakai idre, mabuno du bogl munga igne, deno muduno wida dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Ana God yegl ere, nono ere si di yugwa pre ene ogono kaglno mir erabuka i pre wige ere, adigl gigledi mogl, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />konbauna du duglo bogl moraiglkwa paugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ame Wakai Digwa 4.26</char></note> Ene kaglno wagagl ta erekre, u wakai enabuka pre yegl eraiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nono God mokono tekramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Ana ene yoba mudu bogl deno muduno swara yenamnedi ersre, mabuno du panabuka i, duglo boramnedi erio. I siragl pre yoba mabuno du duglo bogl moraiglkwa yobamo i keme, ye Yagl Kade kan pogl sinaiglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Ana ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta God yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa i ta kide kodinan, kide panabuka pre ene kan kun erio. Ede ta pare ede mitna pidre, mogo kide koglmere mere yegl, yoba ta God yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa i ta kide kodinan, yoba mere u kide enaiglkwa pre kan kun eraiglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nebi, kide panabuka. Te, yoba ta Iso erumere yegl ere, God moko ta tenan, ama kide panabuka. Iso moglkwa i, ye komono moglsre, taragl wakai wakai inabuka nambamo i, kaya mokna ta erme keme nenabuka i pre topo boglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Te, ene prikwa, Iso okuo nomane kor idre, ye nambamo ikne edenagledi prukwa ba God mane dugwa. Ye kai ersre, namba ikne edenagledi konbo dokugwa ba ye konbomo ta yeikrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Okna ibo Israel yoba ede muglo Sainai mabunomugl eigwa ba ene erme muglo kor ta yomara wigwa. Muglo Sainai i, makadigle yogwa ba muglo meglbi ta yoba kankrikwa mabunomugl i, i mina ene wigwa. Israel yoba i, ede muglo Sainai wigwa igne, muglo ibo doga ta dogo, mim podo kide eruko, ir waga podo ugwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Te, biugel ta boglko, ye prisre, God ka tau dugwa ama prikwa. Ye prikwa igne, ye kudugl gogl, God ka tau ama di noro dinabedi kamage yeigwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />I siragl pre God ka ta dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba mo agl bugla pra, ta u muglo meglbi akenan, ene kobuglo mina si, ye si golo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 19.12-13</char></note> dugwa. Yegl dugo, Israel yoba kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ye taragl tau kanigwa i, yoba kandre, kudugl goraiglkwa mere yegl paugwa pre Moses ama dugwa i, Na kudugl goglsre, ogona nagna nuglo dume dugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ba ene ede muglo Saion udre, God kor aimadi moglkwa i dumomo, Jerusalem ta heven ibo yomara i, u kodigwa mere yegl paugwa. Dumo i, angelo mere kide kaima, nono ta keremun, kuno erekrabuka i, gun yei, makai si meglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Te, heven ibo i, God gagiglma ye kagno heven bukmo mina paugo, ye ede okna eigwa meglkwa i, makai sigo, te God ye yoba mudu jasno moglkwa i moglko, erimara i, ede suna wigwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, heven ibo i, yoba ta du moglsre, u wakai pi kodigwa i, kiano bogl meglko, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Heven ibo Jisas moglko, bormaimo ama yogwa. Abel goglkwa igne, ye bormaimo God Kein si gorabedi agle dugwa ba Jisas bormaimo nono mina si plai si edidre, ka wakai keme di moglkwa. Te, nono God bogl kuda ikne ikne munga ikra, promis kor ake ple di norabedi Jisas suna mogl, bo buko di norsre, deno muduno wida di inaiglmedi erukwa. Taragl mudu i, heven ibo yogo, ene heven ibo ede suna u kodigwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Ana God ene erme ka di te moglkwa i, ye mokono te dinamnedi kan kun erio. Moses okna makandigle mogl, Israel yoba ka gigledi di togo, yoba ye kamo i ta sedigwa igne i yubun keme igwa. Yegl pre yoba ta erme heven ibo moglsre, nono ka di norukwa i, kamo sedumun, yubun ta ikramnedi primo? Ta manabuka.<verse eid="HEB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />God okna Israel yoba ka di togwa igne, ye ka dugo, dumo makan piga dugwa. Ba ye erme ka kaima ta di noro padiglsre, yegl dugwa, Na ege swara ta ama dumo makan ake piga didre, kamun mitna ama ake piga dinagle dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ana ye ege swara ta dumo makan ya kamun mitna ake piga dinagle dumara i mina ye i nogugl edugwa i, ye taragl tau ere yogwa piga dinabuka mere yegl paigwa i, okuo taragl tau piga dikrabuka i keme panaiglmedi taragl mudu ake piga didre, si dudu kodinabuka.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ana nono ede suna umgo, God nono kingno moglsre, suglno moglmara dumo i, ta piga dinan, kuno erekrabuka. Dumo i aimadi kamin yei pai morabuka pre nono God di wakai yei tenamga paugwa. Te, nono ye kuduglmo goglsre, ye pre i mitna ede, yene wakai ta kanabere mere ye kogonmo ere tenamga paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />I siragl pre nono Godno moglkwa i, doga ta taragl kane kane de tege erumere mere yegl, ye yobuglomo podo kide yegl paugwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 4.24</char></note> pre nono ye kuduglmo goramga paugwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ka kidine swara swarade i pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Ene agroma abaroma deno muduno tenaiglkwa mabuno i, ere pai molo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Te, yoba yogugl ere wakai ere teigwa mabuno i, kide kodokrio. Ene pre kodigwa, okna yoba tau yoba yogugl wigo, ere wakai ere tomnedi prikwa ba ye angelo wigo, ere wakai ere teigwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Ene agroma abaroma tau kane yugu pai meglkwa i, no ye bogl akie kane pamga mere yegl pamiwedi prisre, ye pre molo. Te, agroma abaroma tau yoba ye ere kide ere te meglkwa i, nono ye bogl yoba swara munedi prisre, pre molo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Yagl abu bogl inaiglkwa mabuno pre mitna edio. Te marit ere kide ere dinamnedi kunogl nekrio. I siragl pre kumugl abai mo yagl abu ta ye yagl abu pere bogl kunogl nenaiglkwa i, God ye ka tage tenabuka.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Ene mogl pai eraiglmara mige moni bubuno goglkrio. Ene taragl ta kan neigwa i, i pra kan nomnedi prio. I siragl pre God yene dra mina didre, Na ka kaima ene kide kodokre, na mokona ene ka kaima ta tekraluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 31.6-8 ya Josua 1.5</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Yegl pre God nono suglno moglmedi pre gi didre, yegl dinamga paugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Yagl Kade na ake ple di nare moglkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">pre na kudugl ta goglkraglka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Yoba ta na ere kide ere naraiglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">kuno ta erekrumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.6</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 13:6">di, yegl dinamga.<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Ana yoba tau ene suglno moglsre, God kamo ene beke teigwa ta moraiglkwa i, ye mabunono i, mogo wakai siragl mere koglkwa i, enene kanigwa pre ene ye mabuno erikwa i poglo di prisre, pre medigl meglmere yegl ene ama pre medigl molo.<verse eid="HEB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Jisas Krais ye eduedi moglmere yegl, erme moglsre, aimadi kamin ama yegl mere mogl pai morabuka. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Yegl pre yoba ka kor kane kane ta yu didre, ene gudu i ede eglke enamnedi eribi, ene ye kano prikrio. God nono yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa ka i, ene deno muduno mina yobuglo bogl tenan, wakai panabuka. Ba yoba tau kaya mokna yegl yegl ta nekrio dinaiglkwa i, ene prikrio. Yoba ka yegl duglo beglkwa i, ye ta ake ple di tekrukwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba ye sel yugu mina kogon erikwa i, yoba tau tawa i pi teigwa igne, ye mie tau gagl tege ersre, tau yene nedre, erikwa. Ba nono tawa bogl pere ta mina taragl wakai wakai imga i, ye ta ibi, kuno erekrabuka.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i ye yoba tadaglmeno si bi dinagledi agl bugla tau, si goglsre, bormaino kogl i pi dumo mawagl podo pamara God togwa. Ba agl bugla ogono nagino i, yoba i pi meda, yugu togl ta yeikrumara gaiglkwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" /><figure style="fig" alt="Three crosses seen through an archway" file="hk00325b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="13.12" />Yegl gaiglkwa pre Jisas ye yene bormaimo mina yoba ere i du edenagledi giugl prukwa i, ye togl meda pidre, giugl prukwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Yegl pre nono ama ye bogl akie togl meda mere yegl pidre, moramga paugwa. Te, yoba ye kiam sidre, gauglmo erimere yegl, nono ama yubun yegl inamga paugwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />I siragl pre nono erme makandigle munga i, aimadi kamin moramga siti i ta yeikrukwa ba nono siti ta okuo unabuka i mina kipai moramnedi sugl munga.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Ana nono Jisas kagie i mina God ege ege kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Nono yegl eramnara i mina ofa ta God tomga mere yegl panabuka. Ofa i, nono drano mina ye di wakai yei tenamga pre diga. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Te, ene ama yoba pere ere wakai ere tedre, ye ake ple di tenamnedi taragl tau teigwa mabuno i, kide kodokrio. Ene mabuno yegl erimara i mina, God ofa ta ama teigwa mere yegl paugo, God ofa i wakai kanugwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Ana yoba tau ene pre mediglkwa yoba suglno meglkwa i, ene wakai moraiglmedi ake ple di tedre, suglno meglkwa. Te, ye okuo kogon siragl mere erikwa i, God di pogl tenaiglkwa paugwa. Yegl pre ene ye moraiglmara mogl atne edidre, ye kano prio. Ene mogl atne edibi, ye gun yei, kogon eribi, wakai panabuka. Ba ene yegl ta erekribi, ye kide prisre, kogon eribi, ene taragl wakai ta ikre, ame wakai dikraiglkwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Ana no pre gi dumga i, no God gumuglo mina aglau ta erekrumnedi pre gi dumga. Te, no mabuno kane kane ta eramga i, mabuno wakai keme eramnedi prumga pre ene kamage ere noribi, i wakai panabuka. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Te, na taragl podo ta pamedi prika i, ene kamage ere naribi, na ene meglmara tabre ede ikne unagledi prika.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka dudumara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20-21" />Ana ka las dinaglka i, yegl dinariwa. God ene deno muduno wida di inaiglmedi ersre, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ere i kor edugwa. Ye Jisas yobuglomo mina ene yobuglo bogl tenan, mabuno wakai kane kane, ye wakai kandre, ene eraiglmedi prukwa i, ene kaima eraiglmedi erabiwa. Jisas sipsip sugl moglkwa yagl kade kaima moglkwa. Te, promis kor aimadi kamin panabedi ye bormaimo suru edumara i mina nono ye kagie kade aimadi kamun te pai moramga. Kaima.<verse eid="HEB 13:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Agrama abarama wagle, ene deno muduno si gigle di tenagledi ka olto ta boglkrika pre sugunagle ta boglmere ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglmedi kamage yeiga.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Ana na ka ta ene di tebo, ene praiglmedi prika i, yegl paugwa, nono agro Timoti kane yugu paugwa i, ye i meda edigwa. Ye ere mogl, tabre na moglmara unan, na ene meglmara unaglka igne, ye bogl akie u ene kanabuglka.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Ana ene suglno yoba ta moraiglkwa i ya te, God yobama mudu moraiglkwa i, ene no drano idre, wakai we di teo. Te, ene agroma abaroma kantri Itali meglkwa i, ene ama wakai we di teigwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />God ene mudu yoko kaima ere wakai ere te pai morabedi prika.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>